    <!-- =========================
         WHY PARAVOLLEY
    ========================== -->
    <section class="about-modern-section about-why-modern">

        <div class="container">

            <div class="row align-items-center g-5">

                <div class="col-lg-7">

                    <span class="about-modern-label">
                        WHY PARAVOLLEY?
                    </span>

                    <h2 class="about-why-title">
                        More Than
                        <span>Just a Sport.</span>
                    </h2>

                    <div class="about-modern-line"></div>

                    <p class="about-why-lead">
                        ParaVolley creates opportunities that extend beyond
                        the volleyball court.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        It helps athletes develop confidence, friendships,
                        leadership skills, discipline and a strong sense
                        of belonging.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        By growing ParaVolley in Mpumalanga, we are working
                        towards a sporting environment where athletes with
                        disabilities are visible, supported and given the
                        opportunity to succeed.
